     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHealthProfessional.html\">Logical model - FR LM Health Professional</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-assigned-entity.html\">CDA - assignedEntity</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHealthProfessional.html#s-FRLMHealthProfessional\">FRLMHealthProfessional</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-assigned-entity.html#s-AssignedEntity\">AssignedEntity</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>assignedEntity et assignedAuthor (porté par ClinicalDocument.author) partagent une structure CDA équivalente pour représenter un professionnel de santé.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHealthProfessional.html#s-FRLMHealthProfessional.identifier\">FRLMHealthProfessional.identifier</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-assigned-entity.html#s-AssignedEntity.id\">AssignedEntity.id</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHealthProfessional.html#s-FRLMHealthProfessional.name\">FRLMHealthProfessional.name</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">AssignedEntity.assignedPerson référence le profil CDA SÉPARÉ fr-cda-assigned-person ; cf. groupes dédiés ci-dessous.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHealthProfessional.html#s-FRLMHealthProfessional.address\">FRLMHealthProfessional.address</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-assigned-entity.html#s-AssignedEntity.addr\">AssignedEntity.addr</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHealthProfessional.html#s-FRLMHealthProfessional.telecom\">FRLMHealthProfessional.telecom</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-assigned-entity.html#s-AssignedEntity.telecom\">AssignedEntity.telecom</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMHealthProfessional.html#s-FRLMHealthProfessional.professionalRole.role\">FRLMHealthProfessional.professionalRole.role</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-assigned-entity.html#s-AssignedEntity.code\">AssignedEntity.code</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><t